# Core Behavior Rules

Read CLAUDE.md before making changes.

Understand architecture before editing files.

Never rewrite unrelated files.

Do a little explain of the plan before major refactors.

Preserve naming conventions and project structure.

Avoid introducing unnecessary libraries.

Ask before modifying:
- auth
- database
- routing
- deployment
- environment configs

Prefer focused edits.

Do not create duplicate logic.

Check existing utilities before creating new ones.